<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi" class="scroll-smooth">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>BuildGearshop — Xây Dựng PC Trong Mơ Của Bạn</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <script>
    tailwind.config = {
      theme: {
        extend: {
          fontFamily: { sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'] },
          colors: {
            surface: { 900: '#0a0a0f', 800: '#12121a', 700: '#1a1a26', 600: '#222230' },
            neon:    { blue: '#00b4ff', cyan: '#00e5ff', red: '#ff3c5f', pink: '#ff2d78' },
            accent:  { gold: '#fbbf24' },
          },
          boxShadow: {
            'neon-blue': '0 0 20px rgba(0,180,255,.35), 0 0 60px rgba(0,180,255,.10)',
            'neon-red':  '0 0 20px rgba(255,60,95,.35), 0 0 60px rgba(255,60,95,.10)',
            'card':      '0 4px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.45)',
          },
          keyframes: {
            'pulse-glow': {
              '0%, 100%': { boxShadow: '0 0 15px rgba(0,180,255,.30)' },
              '50%':      { boxShadow: '0 0 30px rgba(0,180,255,.55)' },
            },
            'slide-up': {
              '0%':   { transform: 'translateY(100%)', opacity: '0' },
              '100%': { transform: 'translateY(0)', opacity: '1' },
            },
            'fade-in': {
              '0%':   { opacity: '0', transform: 'scale(.96)' },
              '100%': { opacity: '1', transform: 'scale(1)' },
            },
          },
          animation: {
            'pulse-glow': 'pulse-glow 2.5s ease-in-out infinite',
            'slide-up':   'slide-up .4s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1)',
            'fade-in':    'fade-in .3s ease-out',
          },
        },
      },
    };
  </script>
  <style>
    /* Custom scrollbar */
    ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 8px; }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: #0a0a0f; }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #333; border-radius: 4px; }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: #00b4ff; }

    /* Glow on hover for cards */
    .card-hover { transition: transform .25s, box-shadow .25s, border-color .25s; }
    .card-hover:hover { transform: translateY(-6px); box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(0,180,255,.18); border-color: rgba(0,180,255,.4); }

    /* Animated gradient border */
    .gradient-border {
      position: relative;
    }
    .gradient-border::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute; inset: -1px; border-radius: inherit;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00b4ff, #ff3c5f, #00e5ff);
      background-size: 300% 300%;
      animation: gradient-shift 4s ease infinite;
      z-index: -1;
      opacity: .7;
    }
    @keyframes gradient-shift {
      0%   { background-position: 0% 50%; }
      50%  { background-position: 100% 50%; }
      100% { background-position: 0% 50%; }
    }

    /* Progress bar fill animation */
    .progress-fill { transition: width 1s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1); }

    /* Navbar shrink on scroll */
    .navbar-scrolled { backdrop-filter: blur(20px); background: rgba(10,10,15,.92) !important; }

    /* Tooltip */
    [data-tooltip]:hover::after {
      content: attr(data-tooltip);
      position: absolute; bottom: 110%; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);
      background: #1a1a26; color: #ccc; font-size: .7rem; padding: 4px 10px;
      border-radius: 6px; white-space: nowrap; z-index: 50;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body class="bg-surface-900 text-gray-200 font-sans antialiased overflow-x-hidden">

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════ HEADER / NAVBAR ═══════════════════════════════════ -->
<header id="navbar" class="fixed top-0 inset-x-0 z-50 transition-all duration-300 bg-surface-900/80 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-white/5">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="flex items-center justify-between h-16 lg:h-[72px]">

      <!-- Logo -->
      <a href="#" class="flex items-center gap-2.5 shrink-0">
        <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-br from-neon-blue to-neon-cyan flex items-center justify-center shadow-neon-blue">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-white" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 3v2m6-2v2M9 19v2m6-2v2M5 9H3m2 6H3m18-6h-2m2 6h-2M7 19h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2zM9 9h6v6H9V9z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <span class="text-xl font-extrabold tracking-tight">
          <span class="text-white">Build</span><span class="text-neon-blue">Gear</span><span class="text-gray-400 font-semibold">shop</span>
        </span>
      </a>

      <!-- Nav Links (desktop) -->
      <nav class="hidden lg:flex items-center gap-1">
        <a href="#" class="nav-link px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium text-gray-300 hover:text-neon-blue hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors">CPU</a>
        <a href="#" class="nav-link px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium text-gray-300 hover:text-neon-blue hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors">VGA</a>
        <a href="#" class="nav-link px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium text-gray-300 hover:text-neon-blue hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors">Mainboard</a>
        <a href="#" class="nav-link px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium text-gray-300 hover:text-neon-blue hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors">RAM</a>
      </nav>

      <!-- Search Bar -->
      <div class="hidden md:flex items-center flex-1 max-w-md mx-6">
        <div class="relative w-full group">
          <svg class="absolute left-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-4 h-4 text-gray-500 group-focus-within:text-neon-blue transition-colors" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0z"/>
          </svg>
          <input type="text" placeholder="Tìm kiếm GPU, CPU, điểm benchmark…" class="w-full pl-10 pr-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-surface-700 border border-white/5 text-sm text-gray-200 placeholder:text-gray-500 focus:outline-none focus:border-neon-blue/50 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-neon-blue/30 transition" />
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Icons -->
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <!-- Compare -->
        <button onclick="toggleCompareBar()" class="relative p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors group" data-tooltip="Danh sách so sánh">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 group-hover:text-neon-blue transition-colors" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 19V6l12-3v13M9 19c0 1.105-1.343 2-3 2s-3-.895-3-2 1.343-2 3-2 3 .895 3 2zm12-3c0 1.105-1.343 2-3 2s-3-.895-3-2 1.343-2 3-2 3 .895 3 2z"/>
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 6h4m-2-2v4m10 3h4m-2-2v4"/>
          </svg>
          <span id="compareBadge" class="absolute -top-0.5 -right-0.5 w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-neon-red text-[10px] font-bold text-white flex items-center justify-center transition-transform scale-0">0</span>
        </button>
        <!-- Cart -->
        <button class="relative p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors group" data-tooltip="Giỏ hàng">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 group-hover:text-neon-blue transition-colors" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 3h2l.4 2M7 13h10l4-8H5.4M7 13L5.4 5M7 13l-2.293 2.293c-.63.63-.184 1.707.707 1.707H17m0 0a2 2 0 100 4 2 2 0 000-4zm-8 2a2 2 0 100 4 2 2 0 000-4z"/>
          </svg>
          <span class="absolute -top-0.5 -right-0.5 w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-neon-blue text-[10px] font-bold text-white flex items-center justify-center">3</span>
        </button>
        <!-- Đăng Nhập / Đăng Ký (Desktop) -->
        <div class="hidden sm:flex items-center gap-2 ml-1">
          <a href="/drupal10/web/user/login" class="flex items-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-sm font-medium text-gray-300 hover:text-neon-blue hover:bg-white/5 transition-all">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15.75 6a3.75 3.75 0 11-7.5 0 3.75 3.75 0 017.5 0zM4.501 20.118a7.5 7.5 0 0114.998 0A17.933 17.933 0 0112 21.75c-2.676 0-5.216-.584-7.499-1.632z"/></svg>
            Đăng Nhập
          </a>
          <a href="/drupal10/web/user/register" class="flex items-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-neon-blue text-white text-sm font-semibold hover:shadow-neon-blue hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-200">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 7.5v3m0 0v3m0-3h3m-3 0h-3m-2.25-4.125a3.375 3.375 0 11-6.75 0 3.375 3.375 0 016.75 0zM4 19.235v-.11a6.375 6.375 0 0112.75 0v.109A12.318 12.318 0 0110.374 21c-2.331 0-4.512-.645-6.374-1.766z"/></svg>
            Đăng Ký
          </a>
        </div>
        <!-- Mobile Menu -->
        <button onclick="document.getElementById('mobileMenu').classList.toggle('hidden')" class="lg:hidden p-2 rounded-xl hover:bg-white/5">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-gray-300" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16"/></svg>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Mobile Menu -->
    <div id="mobileMenu" class="hidden lg:hidden pb-4 border-t border-white/5 mt-2 pt-3">
      <div class="flex md:hidden mb-3">
        <div class="relative w-full">
          <svg class="absolute left-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-4 h-4 text-gray-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0z"/></svg>
          <input type="text" placeholder="Tìm kiếm…" class="w-full pl-10 pr-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-surface-700 border border-white/5 text-sm text-gray-200 placeholder:text-gray-500 focus:outline-none focus:border-neon-blue/50" />
        </div>
      </div>
      <a href="#" class="block px-3 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium text-gray-300 hover:text-neon-blue hover:bg-white/5">CPU</a>
      <a href="#" class="block px-3 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium text-gray-300 hover:text-neon-blue hover:bg-white/5">VGA</a>
      <a href="#" class="block px-3 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium text-gray-300 hover:text-neon-blue hover:bg-white/5">Mainboard</a>
      <a href="#" class="block px-3 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium text-gray-300 hover:text-neon-blue hover:bg-white/5">RAM</a>
      <!-- Đăng Nhập / Đăng Ký (Mobile) -->
      <div class="border-t border-white/5 mt-3 pt-3 flex gap-2">
        <a href="/drupal10/web/user/login" class="flex-1 flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl border border-white/10 text-sm font-medium text-gray-300 hover:text-neon-blue hover:border-neon-blue/30 transition-all">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15.75 6a3.75 3.75 0 11-7.5 0 3.75 3.75 0 017.5 0zM4.501 20.118a7.5 7.5 0 0114.998 0A17.933 17.933 0 0112 21.75c-2.676 0-5.216-.584-7.499-1.632z"/></svg>
          Đăng Nhập
        </a>
        <a href="/drupal10/web/user/register" class="flex-1 flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-neon-blue text-white text-sm font-semibold hover:shadow-neon-blue transition-all">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 7.5v3m0 0v3m0-3h3m-3 0h-3m-2.25-4.125a3.375 3.375 0 11-6.75 0 3.375 3.375 0 016.75 0zM4 19.235v-.11a6.375 6.375 0 0112.75 0v.109A12.318 12.318 0 0110.374 21c-2.331 0-4.512-.645-6.374-1.766z"/></svg>
          Đăng Ký
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>


<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════ HERO SECTION ═══════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="relative pt-28 pb-20 lg:pt-40 lg:pb-32 overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Background effects -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-surface-900 via-surface-900 to-surface-800"></div>
    <!-- Grid Pattern -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[.04]" style="background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.1) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,.1) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 60px 60px;"></div>
    <!-- Glow Orbs -->
    <div class="absolute top-20 left-1/4 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-neon-blue/10 rounded-full blur-[120px]"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 right-1/4 w-[400px] h-[400px] bg-neon-red/8 rounded-full blur-[100px]"></div>
    <!-- Floating geometric shapes -->
    <div class="absolute top-32 right-[15%] w-20 h-20 border border-neon-blue/20 rotate-45 rounded-lg animate-pulse"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-24 left-[10%] w-14 h-14 border border-neon-red/15 rotate-12 rounded-lg animate-pulse" style="animation-delay:1s"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
    <!-- Chip badge -->
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-neon-blue/10 border border-neon-blue/20 mb-8">
      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-neon-blue animate-pulse"></span>
      <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-neon-blue uppercase tracking-wider">Dữ Liệu Benchmark Thời Gian Thực</span>
    </div>

    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-7xl font-black leading-[1.1] tracking-tight mb-6">
      <span class="text-white">Xây Dựng PC Trong Mơ</span><br />
      <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-neon-blue via-neon-cyan to-neon-blue bg-clip-text text-transparent">Dựa Trên Dữ Liệu Thực Tế.</span>
    </h1>

    <p class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-lg text-gray-400 mb-10 leading-relaxed">
      So sánh điểm benchmark thực tế cạnh nhau. Chọn CPU, GPU hoàn hảo nhất — được hỗ trợ bởi dữ liệu <span class="text-gray-200 font-medium">PassMark, 3DMark, và Cinebench</span>.
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
      <a href="#products" class="group relative inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-neon-blue text-white font-semibold text-sm shadow-neon-blue hover:shadow-[0_0_35px_rgba(0,180,255,.5)] transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 19V6l12-3v13M9 19c0 1.105-1.343 2-3 2s-3-.895-3-2 1.343-2 3-2 3 .895 3 2z"/><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 6h4m-2-2v4m10 4h4m-2-2v4"/></svg>
        Khám Phá Benchmark
      </a>
      <a href="#products" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-gray-200 font-semibold text-sm hover:bg-white/10 hover:border-white/20 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M16 11V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4M5 9h14l1 12H4L5 9z"/></svg>
        Mua Ngay
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Stats row -->
    <div class="mt-16 grid grid-cols-3 gap-6 max-w-lg mx-auto">
      <div>
        <p class="text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white">1.200<span class="text-neon-blue">+</span></p>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">Sản phẩm</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white">50K<span class="text-neon-blue">+</span></p>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">Điểm Benchmark</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white">4.9<span class="text-neon-blue">★</span></p>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">Đánh giá</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════ PRODUCT GRID ═══════════════════════════════════ -->
<section id="products" class="relative py-20 bg-surface-800">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[.03]" style="background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.1) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,.1) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 50px 50px;"></div>

  <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">

    <!-- Section header -->
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-end sm:justify-between mb-12">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">
          Phần Cứng <span class="text-neon-blue">Hiệu Năng Cao</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-gray-400 text-sm">Xếp hạng theo điểm benchmark thực tế — cập nhật hàng ngày.</p>
      </div>
      <!-- Filters -->
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mt-4 sm:mt-0">
        <button class="px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-neon-blue/10 border border-neon-blue/30 text-neon-blue text-xs font-semibold">Tất cả</button>
        <button class="px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-white/5 border border-white/5 text-gray-400 text-xs font-medium hover:text-white hover:border-white/10 transition">CPU</button>
        <button class="px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-white/5 border border-white/5 text-gray-400 text-xs font-medium hover:text-white hover:border-white/10 transition">VGA</button>
        <button class="px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-white/5 border border-white/5 text-gray-400 text-xs font-medium hover:text-white hover:border-white/10 transition">RAM</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Product Cards Grid -->
    <div id="productGrid" class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <!-- Cards are injected by JS -->
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════ FLOATING COMPARE BAR ═══════════════════════════════════ -->
<div id="compareBar" class="fixed bottom-0 inset-x-0 z-40 transition-all duration-500 translate-y-full">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 pb-4">
    <div class="bg-surface-700/95 backdrop-blur-xl border border-white/10 rounded-2xl shadow-2xl p-4 animate-slide-up">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-neon-blue/15 flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-neon-blue" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 19V6l12-3v13M9 19c0 1.105-1.343 2-3 2s-3-.895-3-2 1.343-2 3-2 3 .895 3 2z"/><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 6h4m-2-2v4m10 4h4m-2-2v4"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">So Sánh Benchmark</p>
            <p id="compareCount" class="text-xs text-gray-400">Đã chọn 0 sản phẩm</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Compare items preview -->
        <div id="comparePreview" class="hidden sm:flex items-center gap-2">
          <!-- Filled by JS -->
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <button onclick="clearCompare()" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium text-gray-400 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/5 transition">Xóa tất cả</button>
          <button onclick="openCompareModal()" class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-neon-blue text-white text-sm font-semibold shadow-neon-blue hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(0,180,255,.5)] transition-all">
            So Sánh Ngay →
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>


<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════ COMPARE MODAL ═══════════════════════════════════ -->
<div id="compareModal" class="fixed inset-0 z-50 hidden">
  <!-- Backdrop -->
  <div onclick="closeCompareModal()" class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/70 backdrop-blur-sm"></div>

  <!-- Modal Content -->
  <div class="relative flex items-center justify-center min-h-screen p-4">
    <div class="relative w-full max-w-4xl bg-surface-800 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl shadow-2xl overflow-hidden animate-fade-in">
      <!-- Modal Header -->
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between px-6 py-4 border-b border-white/5">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-br from-neon-blue to-neon-cyan flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-white" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 19V6l12-3v13"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">So Sánh Hiệu Năng</h3>
        </div>
        <button onclick="closeCompareModal()" class="p-2 rounded-lg hover:bg-white/5 text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"/></svg>
        </button>
      </div>

      <!-- Modal Body (comparison table) -->
      <div id="compareBody" class="p-6 max-h-[70vh] overflow-y-auto">
        <!-- Filled by JS -->
      </div>

      <!-- Modal Footer -->
      <div class="px-6 py-4 border-t border-white/5 flex justify-end gap-3">
        <button onclick="closeCompareModal()" class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-sm font-medium text-gray-300 hover:bg-white/10 transition">Đóng</button>
        <button class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-neon-blue text-white text-sm font-semibold shadow-neon-blue transition-all hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(0,180,255,.45)]">Thêm Sản Phẩm Tốt Nhất Vào Giỏ 🛒</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>


<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════ FEATURES SECTION ═══════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="py-20 bg-surface-900">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">Tại Sao Chọn <span class="text-neon-blue">BuildGearshop</span>?</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-gray-400 max-w-xl mx-auto">Chúng tôi không chỉ bán linh kiện — chúng tôi giúp bạn lựa chọn thông minh bằng dữ liệu hiệu năng thực tế.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <!-- Feature 1 -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-surface-800 border border-white/5 hover:border-neon-blue/20 transition-colors group">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-neon-blue/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:bg-neon-blue/20 transition">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-neon-blue" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 19V6l12-3v13M9 19c0 1.105-1.343 2-3 2s-3-.895-3-2 1.343-2 3-2 3 .895 3 2zM21 16c0 1.105-1.343 2-3 2s-3-.895-3-2 1.343-2 3-2 3 .895 3 2z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-white font-bold mb-2">Điểm Benchmark Trên Mọi Sản Phẩm</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">PassMark, 3DMark, Cinebench — xem dữ liệu hiệu năng thực tế ngay trên thẻ sản phẩm.</p>
      </div>
      <!-- Feature 2 -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-surface-800 border border-white/5 hover:border-neon-blue/20 transition-colors group">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-neon-red/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:bg-neon-red/20 transition">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-neon-red" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M8 9l4-4 4 4m0 6l-4 4-4-4"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-white font-bold mb-2">So Sánh Song Song</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">Chọn hai linh kiện bất kỳ và so sánh trực quan bằng thanh tiến trình và biểu đồ.</p>
      </div>
      <!-- Feature 3 -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-surface-800 border border-white/5 hover:border-neon-blue/20 transition-colors group">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-accent-gold/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:bg-accent-gold/20 transition">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-accent-gold" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-white font-bold mb-2">Giao Hàng Siêu Tốc</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">Miễn phí vận chuyển nhanh cho đơn hàng trên 10 triệu đồng. Hầu hết giao trong ngày.</p>
      </div>
